Local modifications to FAST_LIO
================================

This subtree is based on FAST_LIO revision
7cc4175de6f8ba2edf34bab02a42195b141027e9. It is distributed under the GNU
General Public License version 2.0; see LICENSE in this directory.

Changes made by YANDEX LLC on 2026-06-08:

- src/laserMapping.cpp integrates DDS odometry publishing (raw and
  EWMA-filtered), local filtering, residual trimming, normal visualization and
  map load/save/freeze, and drops the Python/matplotlib dependency.
- src/IMU_Processing.hpp adds forward IMU propagation and separate point-cloud
  undistortion, and moves IMU initialization into UndistortPcl.
- CMakeLists.txt builds with C++17, links CycloneDDS, tf2_ros and
  visualization_msgs, and adds the DDS odometry sources and the map_builder
  target.
- src/preprocess.h declares the Velodyne ring field as std::uint16_t.
- package.xml adds the tf2_ros and livox_ros_driver2 dependencies.
- config/mid360.yaml sets blind to 0.2 and pcd_save_en to false.
- src/ewma.h implements local pose smoothing.
- src/map_builder.cpp implements local map construction.
- include/odometry_data.idl, include/odometry_data.hpp, and
  src/odometry_data.cpp implement the DDS odometry data type.

Each modified or added source file carries a notice with its change date.

Changes made by YANDEX LLC on 2026-08-31:

- Corrected package.xml to declare GPL-2.0-only.
- Removed the unused matplotlib-cpp header and its Python build dependencies.

Changes made by YANDEX LLC on 2026-10-02:

